"""Offline structural validator for SPDX 2.3 JSON documents.

Encodes the required-field rules from the SPDX 2.3 spec and JSON schema.
Usage: python3 validate_sbom.py sbom.spdx.json
Exit code 0 = no FAIL findings, 1 = at least one FAIL.
